  <FlexGrid>
    <Fragment slot="left">
      <Section>
        <p>
          I'm a Senior Software Engineer at GitHub and independent Web
          Developer with 10 years of professional experience.
        </p>

        <p>
          Here's a list of my creations. Each has a brief description and don't
          miss out on the embedded demos!
        </p>

        <p>
          To learn more please
          <a href="mailto:nicozessoules@gmail.com">reach out<span>!</span></a>
        </p>
      </Section>

